* 至少一个 \(\mathcal T_j(s)\neq0\) 对每个 \(s\in K\)。

定义 sesquiholomorphic Gram kernels：

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal G_{\mathcal P}(s,t)
=
\sum_{j=1}^{r}
w_j\,
\mathcal P_j(s)
\overline{\mathcal P_j(t)},
}
\tag{316.2}
$$

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal G_{\mathcal T}(s,t)
=
\sum_{j=1}^{r}
w_j\,
\mathcal T_j(s)
\overline{\mathcal T_j(t)}.
}
\tag{316.3}
$$

由式 (316.1)：

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal G_{\mathcal P}(s,t)
=
\xi(s)\overline{\xi(t)}
\mathcal G_{\mathcal T}(s,t).
}
\tag{316.4}
$$

在对角附近：

$$
\mathcal G_{\mathcal T}(s,t)\neq0.
$$

定义局部商核：

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal R_K(s,t)
=
\frac{
\mathcal G_{\mathcal P}(s,t)
}{
\mathcal G_{\mathcal T}(s,t)
}.
}
\tag{316.5}
$$

则：

$$
\boxed{
\mathcal R_K(s,t)
=
\xi(s)\overline{\xi(t)}.
}
\tag{316.6}
$$

